 "about": "The other kinds of client control and the templates (scene_add_client_template), in one screen. A dark panel and a yellow star above it are image controls given their picture and colour in scene_add_client_ui: they show without the script touching them. In the middle a grid (网格视窗) of twelve items, each a copy of the template CL_cell (a dark tile with a star the script tints yellow or blue by its index). Above, a row of red discs the script makes at run time from the template CL_dot (game.InstantiateClientUIControl): three at the start, one more for every click on the preset button below (the script clicks it at play seconds 4 and 6) and for the 1 key (at 8): six discs at the end, three CL_MORE prints from the graph. The script reads the index of a template from a reference control that names it (referencedPrefabIndex), so no number is written into the Lua. Left of the grid a reference shows the template CL_cell itself; right of it a key hint shows the key 1.",
